# Names

* Function apps should have remote debugging turned off (0e60b895-3786-45da-8377-9c6b4b6ac5f9)

# Description

Remote debugging requires inbound ports to be opened on Function apps. Remote debugging should be turned off.

# Policy Rule

```json
{
  "if": {
    "allOf": [
      {
        "field": "type",
        "equals": "Microsoft.Web/sites"
      },
      {
        "field": "kind",
        "contains": "functionapp"
      },
      {
        "field": "kind",
        "notContains": "workflowapp"
      },
      {
        "field": "kind",
        "notContains": "azurecontainerapps"
      }
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "effect": "[parameters('effect')]",
    "details": {
      "type": "Microsoft.Web/sites/config",
      "existenceCondition": {
        "field": "Microsoft.Web/sites/config/web.remoteDebuggingEnabled",
        "equals": "false"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
